  "definition": "Continuing Education",
  "effectiveDate": "2013-10-31",
  "historyNote": "#7119, eff 10-16-99; ss by #7894, eff 5-21-03; ss by #8593, eff 3-28-06; ss by #10453, eff 10-31-13",
